<span class="article-embedded_caption">Yamal becomes youngest EURO goalscorer</span></div><h2><b>Young player to appear in knockout stage</b></h2><p><b>Lamine Yamal (16 years 353 days)</b><br/>Jude Bellingham laid down the previous benchmark after helping England defeat Ukraine in the quarter-finals at EURO 2020, but Yamal has now snared this record too. The Spain youngster not only started the <a href="https://www.uefa.com/euro2024/match/2036199--spain-vs-georgia/" notaddlevel="true" target="_self">4-1 round of 16 defeat of Georgia</a> at EURO 2024 but provided an assist for FabiÃ¡n Ruiz to put La Roja in front after they had fallen behind.</p><div class="article-embedded_video pull-left embedded-image-single embedded-image-big d3-plugin" data-plugin="videoavailability" data-options="{&quot;videoIds&quot;:[&quot;028f-1b6385a304af-b2c259b15bcd-1000&quot;]}" >

