<span class="article-embedded_caption">Highlights: Spain 4-1 Georgia</span></div><h2><strong>Youngest player to appear in a final</strong></h2><p><strong>Lamine Yamal (17 years 1 day)</strong><br/>The winger made it a hat-trick of youth records as <a href="https://www.uefa.com/euro2024/match/2036211--spain-vs-england/" notaddlevel="true" target="_blank">Spain defeated England to triumph</a> at EURO 2024, taking the mantle from midfielder Renato Sanches, who was 18 years 328 days old when he appeared in Portugal's <a href="https://www.uefa.com/uefaeuro/match/2017907--portugal-vs-france/" notaddlevel="true" target="_self">shock final triumph</a> against hosts France at EURO 2016.</p><div class="article-embedded_video pull-left embedded-image-single embedded-image-big d3-plugin" data-plugin="videoavailability" data-options="{&quot;videoIds&quot;:[&quot;028f-1b6345f7a71e-53c3d6b590b5-1000&quot;]}" >

