<span class="article-embedded_caption">Highlights: Spain 2-1 England</span></div><h2><strong>Youngest player to score in a final</strong></h2><p><strong>Pietro Anastasi (20 years 64 days)</strong><br/>Anastasi's right-footed volley from outside the box doubled Italy's advantage <a href="https://www.uefa.com/uefaeuro/match/73911--italy-vs-yugoslavia/" notaddlevel="true" target="_self">against Yugoslavia in the 1968 final replay</a> in Rome â and made the striker the youngest EURO final marksman ever. He was renowned for being the world's most expensive player when he joined Juventus from Varese in 1968.</p><div class="article-embedded_video pull-left embedded-image-single embedded-image-big d3-plugin" data-plugin="videoavailability" data-options="{&quot;videoIds&quot;:[&quot;0253-0d7ad877e258-740b442139d8-1000&quot;]}" >

